   "speech": "加法要让一个周期内的和为零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 424.43,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speech": "乘法要让一个周期内的均值是一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 428.66,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "这一步不做，整体水平会漏进季节项。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 433.34,
   "dur": 1.46,
   "speech": "最后残差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 435.35,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "加法是 x 减 t 减 s。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 439.36,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "乘法是 x 除以 t，再除以 s。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 444.04,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speech": "端点不补值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 446.27,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "趋势和残差，两端各 k 个点是空。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 450.95,
   "dur": 3.91,
   "speech": "k 等于 m 除以二，向下取整。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 455.41,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speech": "空不是零，也不是 NaN。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 459.19,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "空就是没有定义。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 461.87,
   "dur": 3.91,
   "speech": "长度下限，n 至少二 m 加一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 466.33,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speech": "移动平均吃掉两端，剩下的点要让每个相位都有观测。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 472.56,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "这就是分解的全部定义。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 475.91,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speech": "下面两个强度，是给分解打分的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 480.14,
   "dur": 5.24,
   "speech": "趋势强度，一减残差方差除以去季节序列的方差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 485.93,
   "dur": 5.24,
   "speech": "季节强度，一减残差方差除以去趋势序列的方差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 491.72,
   "dur": 3.91,
   "speech": "两个都在外面套一个 max 零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 496.17,
   "dur": 1.91,
   "speech": "负值截断到零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 498.63,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "都只在趋势有定义的位置统计。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 502.64,
   "dur": 5.02,
   "speech": "方差是总体方差，除以 n，不是 n 减一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 508.21,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "分母退化，返回零，不返回 NaN。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 512.88,
   "dur": 3.02,
   "speech": "常数序列两个指标都是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 45,
   "start": 516.45,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "一个常数，既没有趋势，也没有季节。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 46,
   "start": 521.13,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "乘法模型，在 log 尺度上套同一公式。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 47,
   "start": 526.47,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speech": "这一条是扩展，书里只写了加法。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 48,
   "start": 530.71,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "参数错，长度不够，乘法遇到非正数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 49,
   "start": 535.38,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "都返回错误，不返回 NaN。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 50,
   "start": 539.39,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speech": "这就是四条错误分支的来历。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 51,
   "start": 543.18,
   "dur": 1.91,
   "speech": "定义到此为止。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 52,
   "start": 545.64,
   "dur": 4.35,
   "speech": "记住三个词：中心化、相位、总体方差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 53,
   "start": 550.54,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "后面所有数字，都从这三步里长出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 54,
   "start": 555.22,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speech": "下一场看图。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 560.3,
   "dur": 2.35,
   "speech": "先回答四个为什么。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 563.2,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "第一个，偶数核为什么不是做两次移动平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 568.54,
   "dur": 2.35,
   "speech": "两种写法代数等价。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 571.44,
   "dur": 2.57,
   "speech": "但直接卷积只走一趟。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 574.57,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "权重和恒为一，一阶矩恒为零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 578.58,
   "dur": 2.57,
   "speech": "常数进去，常数出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 581.7,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "线性序列进去，还是同一条线性序列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 586.38,
   "dur": 5.02,
   "speech": "区间一长，两次移动平均会引入额外端点缺失。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 591.94,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "所以选直接卷积。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 594.62,
   "dur": 3.91,
   "speech": "第二个，季节为什么按相位求均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 599.08,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "如果按日历求均值，每个日期只有一个观测。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 604.42,
   "dur": 2.57,
   "speech": "那是噪声，不是季节。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 607.54,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speech": "按相位，同一个位置跨周期共享。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 611.78,
   "dur": 4.35,
   "speech": "周期五，一周五个交易日，周五对周五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 616.68,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "周期二十一，一个月二十一个交易日。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 621.36,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "相位把不同月份的同一天对齐。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 625.37,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "端点的点仍然有季节值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 628.71,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "缺失只影响趋势和残差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 632.06,
   "dur": 4.35,
   "speech": "第三个，为什么分母是去季节、去趋势。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 636.96,
   "dur": 5.02,
   "speech": "用原始序列当分母，另一项的方差会被算进来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 642.52,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "一个强季节序列，趋势强度会被抬高。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 647.2,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "反过来，长趋势序列，季节强度会被压扁。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 652.32,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "所以分母必须各去各的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 655.67,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "第四个，纯噪声的趋势强度为什么不是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 660.79,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "移动平均把噪声平滑掉一部分。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 664.8,
   "dur": 3.91,
   "speech": "残差方差只剩原来的零点七二五倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 669.26,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "一减，就是零点二七五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 672.6,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "这个数不是趋势。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 675.28,
   "dur": 1.91,
   "speech": "它是核的残余。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 677.73,
   "dur": 2.35,
   "speech": "核越长，残余越小。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 680.63,
   "dur": 4.35,
   "speech": "所以零点二七五要跟周期和长度一起看。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 685.53,
   "dur": 2.57,
   "speech": "不能单独当一个门槛。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 688.66,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "看三个合成序列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 691.33,
   "dur": 2.57,
   "speech": "纯趋势，上升的直线。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 694.46,
   "dur": 3.02,
   "speech": "趋势强度一，季节强度零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 698.02,
   "dur": 4.35,
   "speech": "纯周期，十、十三、十六、十九，循环。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 702.92,
   "dur": 1.91,
   "speech": "均值十四点五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 705.38,
   "dur": 5.24,
   "speech": "季节项是负四点五、负一点五、一点五、四点五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 711.17,
   "dur": 3.02,
   "speech": "趋势强度零，季节强度一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 714.73,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speech": "所以指标能把纯规律认出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 718.52,
   "dur": 3.91,
   "speech": "纯噪声，两条都低，但趋势不是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 722.98,
   "dur": 1.91,
   "speech": "再看交换实验。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 725.43,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "趋势加噪声，趋势强度零点九九九五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 730.11,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "季节加噪声，季节强度零点九三四一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 734.79,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speech": "交换过来，趋势强度零点二五八。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 45,
   "start": 739.02,
   "dur": 2.57,
   "speech": "季节强度零点零零七。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 46,
   "start": 742.14,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "两个差值都大于零点五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 47,
   "start": 745.49,
   "dur": 3.02,
   "speech": "这就是两个指标的分辨力。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 48,
   "start": 749.06,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "但分辨力不等于显著性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 49,
   "start": 752.4,
   "dur": 3.02,
   "speech": "这一点，边界那一场再说。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 50,
   "start": 755.97,
   "dur": 3.91,
   "speech": "先记住：零点二七五，是核的脚印。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 51,
   "start": 760.42,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "不是趋势的脚印。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 765.95,
   "dur": 3.02,
   "speech": "三个模块，一个共享类型。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 769.52,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "共享类型放在 Core 里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 773.53,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "因为算法模块之间不许互相 import。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 778.87,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "这是本仓的纪律。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 781.55,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "第一块，Decomp 记录。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 785.56,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "模式，周期，原始序列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 788.91,
   "dur": 4.35,
   "speech": "趋势和残差，都是 Maybe 向量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 793.81,
   "dur": 2.35,
   "speech": "季节项是全长向量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 796.71,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speech": "趋势区间，用一对下标给出。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 800.49,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "第二块，ClassicalDecomp。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 805.84,
   "dur": 1.91,
   "speech": "导出两个函数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 808.29,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speech": "中心化核，和经典分解本身。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 812.08,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "核返回 Either。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 815.43,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "周期小于二，直接报错。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 818.77,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speech": "分解也返回 Either。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 822.56,
   "dur": 2.79,
   "speech": "四类错误，显式列出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 825.91,
   "dur": 2.35,
   "speech": "周期错，长度不够。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 828.81,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "乘法遇到非正数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 831.48,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speech": "乘法除以零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 833.72,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "为什么用 Either，不用异常。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 838.39,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speech": "纯函数，错误是返回值的一部分。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 842.63,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "调用方必须处理。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 845.31,
   "dur": 2.35,
   "speech": "第三块，两个强度。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 848.21,
   "dur": 2.35,
   "speech": "每个模块两个函数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 851.11,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speech": "一个给强度，一个给方差比。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 854.89,
   "dur": 4.13,
   "speech": "方差比单独导出，测试和画面都要用。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 859.57,
   "dur": 3.46,
   "speech": "退化时返回 Nothing。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 863.58,
   "dur": 3.91,
   "speech": "外层把 Nothing 变成零。"
  },
  {
